          "abnormal development of radial side limb",
          "radial bone defects"
        ]
      },
      {
        "symptomName": "Chromosomal hypersensitivity to DNA cross-linking agents",
        "frequency": 0.95,
        "bodySystem": "hematological",
        "notes": "Detected by diepoxybutane or mitomycin C testing",
        "searchTerms": [
